<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Toxicate</h1>
<p>Sphere: Poison Sphere
Class: Assassin (guild level 20, up to 80%), Sorcerer (guild level 37)
Mana: 25
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast toxicate &lt;target&gt;
cast toxicate &lt;food or drink&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast toxicate</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster curves a finger like a scorpion's tail, points and utters 
'Entahc', and poison burns in the target's veins. Every 15 seconds the 
victim loses hit points, and twice as much mana and endurance. The better 
your spell, the longer the poison lasts and the harder it burns: a weak one 
is over at once, a master's lasts nearly three minutes and takes over a 
hundred hit points in all. A poisoned victim can die of it.
</p><p>Cast on food or a drink that isn't poisoned already, it poisons it, and 
whoever eats or drinks it falls ill.
</p><p>The victim resists, and the spell may fail; either way, casting it on 
someone starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, and no free hands 
are needed. It is also found on potions, wands and scrolls. Remove poison 
drives the poison out, and so can dispel magic when it is strong enough.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Poison</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Poison</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Poison Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Poison Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>